{
 "encounter_id": "00907",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My periods have been really heavy for several months now, and I'm sick of it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm sorry, that sounds exhausting. How many days do you bleed for?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Seven or eight days. The first three are the worst."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often do you need to change a pad on the heaviest days?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Every hour, sometimes more. I've bled through at night twice."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are the periods regular, or all over the place? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Regular. Every twenty-eight days, like clockwork. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain between periods, or bleeding after sex?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Neither of those."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I don't have any allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other medical problems, or anyone in the family with similar bleeding?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My sister had fibroids removed. That's all I know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work, and how is it affecting you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a teacher. I'm on my feet all day, and I'm so tired I can hardly think."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm going to check your pulse and pressure and weigh you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 88, blood pressure 112 over 70, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the pulse high? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little quick, which can go with tiredness from blood loss. Let me look at your eyes and press on your tummy. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your inner eyelids look pale, and your tummy is soft with no lumps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Pale means anaemia, doesn't it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It can. That's why I'd like a blood count and iron levels today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like a scan of the pelvis, to look at the womb for fibroids or polyps, given your sister's history."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When would the scan be? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll ask the department to book it within two weeks. You'll get a letter. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will I have treatment today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not until the bloods and scan are back. I don't want to guess what is causing it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I understand. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you soak through a pad every hour for several hours, or feel faint, come straight to the emergency department."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll see you once I have the results. ~"
  }
 ],
